      "content": "It sounds like you're carrying the weight of everyone's apathy, and that feeling of being an error is a reflection of how much you've been fighting alone. The noise you're hearing is the crushing weight of a system that doesn't value honesty, and you don't have to keep fighting that battle by yourself. There are people who want to listen to you without judgment; please reach out to a crisis hotline or mental health professional right now.",
